# Project rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` and relevant `docs/*.md` before implementing.
- Follow `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md`, `docs/FEATURES.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, and `docs/SECURITY.md`.
- Go is the only backend language. Do not reintroduce Rust or Tauri.
- Keep the core download engine independent from Wails and React.
- Do not implement features outside the current phase without asking.
- Prefer incremental, testable changes.
- Do not claim functionality exists unless code and tests prove it.
- Update documentation when behavior changes.
